<lb n="62"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkaufft</unclear> werden
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">man</unclear> am sambßtag schaezen will, so sollen
